{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Moonriver used to be a quiet town. Now, it's anything but.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a small-town cop thrust into an escalating supernatural crisis. Inspired by \u201880s horror movies and cult shows like <strong>Twin Peaks</strong>, this atmospheric survival shooter features unique mission design, environmental storytelling, and strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/citymaplegend__1_.png?t=1744499541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Investigate using your detective board \u2014 piece clues together to push the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Open world freedom \u2014 drive, explore, scavenge, and survive however you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dynamic missions \u2014 puzzles, stealth, combat, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Physical interaction \u2014 barricade doors, throw objects, break glass to reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Creative survival \u2014 low on ammo? Use stealth or outsmart your enemies.\u00a0<strong>One zombie is no problem, fifteen is a natural disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized hand-drawn graphics and an original dark synth soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/2025-04-1200-46-23-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744499541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f \\~5 hours of story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccd 30 km\u00b2 map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 Made for fans of narrative-driven indies with heart and bite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.