w objects, break glass to reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Creative survival \u2014 low on ammo? Use stealth or outsmart your enemies.\u00a0<strong>One zombie is no problem, fifteen is a natural disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized hand-drawn graphics and an original dark synth soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/2025-04-1200-46-23-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744499541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f \\~5 hours of story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccd 30 km\u00b2 map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 Made for fans of narrative-driven indies with heart and bite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["jetzackgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/header.jpg?t=1744499541","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125409,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125409/movie480.mp4?t=1744499539","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125409/movie_max.mp4?t=1744499539"},"name":"release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125409/529cafb27e3fd5dc9cc4bd06cebd9082278679a9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744499539","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail